  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project support, cont of 71001933: Three main components; A) Land     management - first registration and digitization of land cadastre,    reform of the Immovable Propoerty Registre Office into a modern, semi self-finaced orgnisation, B) Spatial planning - national territorial  plan and muncipal spatial plans, C)Municipal infrastructure - WB      loans for improvement of water, waste water, solid waste etc.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektst&#xf6;d, forts av 71001933: Tre huvudkomponenter: a) Mark         management - f&#xf6;rsta digitalisering av fastighetsregister och          fastighetsregistret, reform av lagen om fast propoerty registren      Office till en modern, semi sj&#xe4;lv finaced orgnisation, B) Fysisk      planering - nationella och regionala planen Muncipal Spatial Plans,   C) Kommunal infrastruktur - WB l&#xe5;n f&#xf6;r f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttring av vatten, avlopps</narrative>
  </description>
